        "original_id": "e4446624-b53b-5fdd-831f-5bfc0790564c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bob Casey Jr., Chris Smith, Barack Obama\n- Laws: Global Food Security Act of 2016\n- Organizations: 114th United States Congress, United States Senate\n- Places: Pennsylvania, New Jersey\n- Roles: United States Senator, President of the United States, Representative\n\nFacts:\n- The Global Food Security Act of 2016 was introduced on March 24, 2015 in the 114th United States Congress by Representative Chris Smith of New Jersey.\n- The Global Food Security Act of 2016 was introduced on May 7, 2015 by Senator Bob Casey Jr. of Pennsylvania.\n- President Barack Obama signed the Global Food Security Act of 2016 into law on July 20, 2016.\n- Bob Casey Jr., born on April 13, 1960, is an American attorney and politician.\n- Bob Casey Jr. is the senior United States Senator from Pennsylvania.",
